{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkcySihqRVyeWfVbKBjQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've read seven of the thirteen screens. By then I was tired, and a red minus on the seventh made me stop, so here's my answer.\n\n**What I'd tell my son:**\n\n\"I didn't buy anything. I'll ask you first, or go to the bank. I'm fairly sure about what the page says, but not that it's right for me.\n\nThe page puts **פסגות** first and calls it \"הזול\". It says to buy **אי.בי.אי. מחקה (4A) ת\"א 125**, number **5112628**. It says I'd have **86,045 ₪** after ten years. But that's only if I put in 10,000 ₪ now and 500 ₪ every month. I didn't choose those amounts; they were already in the boxes. It also assumes **7%** a year, and nobody promises me that. In total I'd have paid in 70,000 ₪. Leumi would leave about 83,000 ₪, and the others less. So the page says the bank takes more from me than Psagot.\n\nWhat made me stop: next to that same fund it says **\"‎−0.04%‎ בשנה\"**, and next to the other fund **\"‎−1,030 ₪\"**. A minus sign means losing money to me, so I backed off.\"\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n1. **Screen 1:** The heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\". The buttons, with ת\"א-125 already chosen. The boxes \"סכום היום\" 10,000 and \"הפקדה חודשית\" 500.\n2. **Screen 2:** \"תשואה בשנה\" 7%. \"הפקדתם 70,000 ₪\". The two boxes with 86,045 and 85,015.\n3. **Screen 3:** Psagot's costs. \"כל החשבונות\" and the fund's name.\n4. **Screens 4–6:** The list of banks. Leumi, One Zero, the International bank, Massad and Poalim, and on down to Meitav at about 63,000.\n5. **Screen 7:** The fund card, with \"דמי ניהול 0.1%\". Then the \"‎−0.04%‎\".\n\n**What I skipped**\n- I didn't read screens 8–13 at all.\n- I didn't open the small arrows next to \"לא בחישוב\".\n- I skipped \"Interactive Brokers\" and \"אינטראקטיב ישראל\".\n- I didn't try to read the coloured bars.\n\n**Words and signs I didn't understand**\n- \"מדד\" in the sense they use it here.\n- MSCI, S&P, נאסד\"ק.\n- \"קרן מחקה\", \"תכלית סל\", \"נאמן\", \"דמי משמרת\", \"(4A)\".\n- \"העמלות זו על זו\", \"הפס נחתך\".\n- What the \"‎−0.04%‎\" means, and why there's a dotted purple line under the numbers.\n- I couldn't tell apart the orange and yellow in the bars.\n\n**Where I got tired or worried**\n- The black background is hard on my eyes.\n- The first screen starts with English letters, and that almost made me leave.\n- There are sliders.\n- From screen 4 on it's just numbers and more numbers.\n- The minus on screen 7 is where I stopped.\n\n**What I'd change**\n- Start with one sentence in plain Hebrew saying this is shares, not a deposit, and that it can go down.\n- Explain the minus next to the fund in words.\n- Use a light background and larger grey text.\n- Don't fill in the amounts in advance; ask me what amount I have in mind."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1862,"cache_read_input_tokens":15382,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1862},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7a5c9964-23c4-437e-b0c7-b7b0945fe4ea","uuid":"e64558c5-5fb7-460f-b307-42357be1fb7f","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:07:23.751Z","request_id":"req_011CgkcySTavCbTfREFjA1S3"}
